{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://puppetmaster.local/proposals/goal_run_stop_block.v1.schema.json",
  "$comment": "Newly authored DL-045 owner contract; TEST_ONLY qualification does not install a source or admit an event. Whole native roots and all independently acquired source values in resource-bank.json are mandatory in addition to these closed durable joins. No SourceMember or hash is native authority.",
